WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:01.560
Bring him in.

00:01.640 --> 00:03.040
Yes.

00:17.880 --> 00:20.560
A nobody not worth mentioning.

00:25.080 --> 00:26.680
You're actually Prince of Jin.

00:27.800 --> 00:29.200
What?

00:29.760 --> 00:31.760
Regret not killing me back then?

00:36.120 --> 00:40.120
Your Highness has the bearing of dragon and phoenix I actually didn't see it.

00:41.080 --> 00:44.520
My eyes are blind not undeserved.

